1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:08,800
NORA: They said the lighthouse was empty for ten years. So who left the light on?

2
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:18,800
SAM: Nora Hale. Ten years, and you still drive like the road owes you money.

3
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:25,389
NORA: I inherited a lighthouse, Sam. Not a welcome party.

4
00:00:25,439 --> 00:00:28,800
SAM: I'm not happy. I'm careful.

5
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:32,952
SAM: The Kellers already had surveyors on your land. Twice.

6
00:00:33,002 --> 00:00:38,300
NORA: Then they can explain it to the state. The trust is mine now.

7
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:44,393
MARGARET: Your father was a liar, dear. Sentiment won't change what the deed says.

8
00:00:44,443 --> 00:00:48,300
NORA: Then you won't mind me reading the deed. Slowly.

9
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:53,702
ADRIAN: Sell us the point. Name your price and leave the past where it belongs.

10
00:00:53,752 --> 00:00:58,300
NORA: The past is the only thing you've ever asked me to leave behind.

11
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:04,827
NORA: You had ten years to buy this land. Why wait until I came back?

12
00:01:04,877 --> 00:01:08,300
MARGARET: Because a deed is cleaner than a funeral.

13
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:16,509
CLAIRE: Your father changed his will three days before he died. That's not nothing.

14
00:01:16,559 --> 00:01:18,300
NORA: Who witnessed it?

15
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:23,525
CLAIRE: Margaret Keller's attorney. And a man named Sam.

16
00:01:23,575 --> 00:01:28,300
NORA: Sam was there that night? At the lighthouse?

17
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:33,525
NORA: Dad... what did you lock in the lighthouse?

18
00:01:33,575 --> 00:01:38,300
NORA: And why did you leave me the key?

19
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:46,708
CLAIRE: The petition says you're unfit to manage the trust. They want a guardian by Friday.

20
00:01:46,758 --> 00:01:48,300
NORA: On what grounds?

21
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:51,138
NORA: Who signed the statement?

22
00:01:51,188 --> 00:01:57,106
CLAIRE: Half the harbor. And one name you won't like: Sam.

23
00:01:57,156 --> 00:01:58,300
NORA: Of course.
